h\\\">Explore<\\/p><nav class=\\\"cn-col-nav\\\" aria-label=\\\"Footer\\\"><a href=\\\"#properties\\\">Properties<\\/a><a href=\\\"#about\\\">Agency<\\/a><a href=\\\"#insights\\\">Insights<\\/a><a href=\\\"#clients\\\">Clients<\\/a><a href=\\\"#contact\\\">Contact<\\/a><\\/nav>\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-cnft05 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\\\" data-id=\\\"cnft05\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-e-type=\\\"widget\\\" data-widget_type=\\\"html.default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"cn-col-h\\\">Contact<\\/p><p class=\\\"cn-col-muted\\\"><a href=\\\"mailto:hello@lumora.com.au\\\">hello@lumora.com.au<\\/a><br><a href=\\\"tel:+61754408899\\\">+61 7 5440 8899<\\/a><br>14 Hastings Street, Noosa QLD 4567<\\/p>\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-cnft06 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\\\" data-id=\\\"cnft06\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-e-type=\\\"widget\\\" data-widget_type=\\\"html.default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"cn-col-h\\\">Hours<\\/p><p class=\\\"cn-col-muted\\\">Mon to Sat, 8:30 to 17:30<br>Private inspections by appointment<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin-top:18px !important\\\"><a class=\\\"cn-quiet-link\\\" href=\\\"#main\\\">Back to top \\u2191<\\/a><\\/p>\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-cnft07 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\\\" data-id=\\\"cnft07\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-e-type=\\\"widget\\\" data-widget_type=\\\"html.default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"cn-col-bar\\\"><p class=\\\"cn-small\\\">\\u00a9 2026 LUMORA Real Estate<\\/p><p class=\\\"cn-small\\\"><a href=\\\"#main\\\">Privacy<\\/a> \\u00b7 <a href=\\\"#main\\\">Terms<\\/a> \\u00b7 Crafted in Noosa<\\/p><\\/div>\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/footer>\\n\\t\\t\",\"scripts\":[],\"styles\":[]}}');
